d question them rigorously  that they're um would see the bankruptcy  of their positions and I would like to  keep doing that with fossil fuel uh you  know Executives and the like I've done a  few uh and with governments you know who  have allowed  um  politics politics to to endanger us all  I do believe those people need to be  held accountable so I would like to be  able to uh ask those people more  questions  well Christian thank you so much for  taking the time to chat with us today I  think it's used for everyone  um just appreciating  um everything that you've shared and  um good luck with the rest of your day  thank you very very much I appreciate it  it was good to talk to you all thanks  Whitney  [Music]

